eel like it, or even bet money on the racers you consider to be the strongest. You\u2019ll also discover more from socializing and attending events in cities where races are big time events. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2175460/extras/a2b288e2d5aa83fec61af63c1c42cf16.avif?t=1704710528\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2175460/extras/70363e3f82f7053b68e19437fc7388c8.poster.avif?t=1704710528\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2175460/extras/70363e3f82f7053b68e19437fc7388c8.webm?t=1704710528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2175460/extras/70363e3f82f7053b68e19437fc7388c8.mp4?t=1704710528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
